title: "研究所師資社會網路分析 (grad-school-social-network)"
abstract: >-
  A social-network analysis of the faculty of 14 graduate programmes in
  Taiwan (computer science, data science, finance and economics). Faculty
  names, titles, education and research fields were collected from public
  departmental web pages, standardised, and modelled as a professor–research
  field bipartite network in order to compare research clusters across
  departments and schools.
